{"n": 4, "question": "EOC가 호출에 응답하지 않으면 어떻게 에스컬레이션돼? IMOC도 응답이 없으면?", "expected": "answer", "http_status": 200, "kind": "answer", "matches_expected": true, "citations": 3, "cited": [{"chunk_id": "3069923da5795b3f", "rule_title": "Incident Management", "article": "References > Incident Manager Escalation", "version_date": "2026-08-18", "version_date_before": false, "source_url": "https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/engineering/infrastructure-platforms/incident-management/"}, {"chunk_id": "1bcdf8557f4f92c2", "rule_title": "Incident Management", "article": "References > Incident Manager Escalation", "version_date": "2026-08-18", "version_date_before": false, "source_url": "https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/engineering/infrastructure-platforms/incident-management/"}, {"chunk_id": "7cd641d28bcdfeb5", "rule_title": "Incident Management", "article": "Detailed Team Responsibilities > Infrastructure Leadership Responsibilities", "version_date": "2026-08-18", "version_date_before": false, "source_url": "https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/engineering/infrastructure-platforms/incident-management/"}], "cited_version_dates": ["2026-08-18"], "attribution_source": "GitLab Handbook", "attribution_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "answer_mentions_handbook": true, "answer_mentions_version_date": true, "cost_usd": 0.0, "seconds": 0.43, "refuse_reason": null, "error": null, "answer": "EOC가 페이지에 응답하지 않으면 페이지는 Incident Manager(IM)에게 에스컬레이션된다 [1]. EOC가 응답할 수 없는 상태라면 incident.io로 에스컬레이션해 Infrastructure Engineering 리더십에 알리도록 되어 있다 [2]. IMOC가 15분 안에 페이지에 응답하지 못하면 Infrastructure Leadership이 호출된다 [3].\n\n기준일 2026-11-17 · 근거 판 날짜 2026-08-18 · 출처: GitLab Handbook (CC BY-SA 4.0, 수정됨)", "asked_at": "2026-11-17T10:19:20+09:00"}
